            "kind": "write",
            "text": "AND IF the mango is ripe..."
          },
          {
            "kind": "success",
            "text": "✅ Then Dabbo can give the mango to the buyer."
          },
          {
            "kind": "info",
            "text": "This kind of decision is called an IF condition in Python."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
